{"id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-sphere.md","title":"Sphere","display":"df-sphere — Sphere","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sphere","aliases":["58-df-sphere","Sphere"],"display":"df-sphere — Sphere","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sphere"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sphere</span><span>Sphere</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sphere — Sphere"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> 使用以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 为定义域的函数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lVert x\\rVert_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in n+1}x(i)^2}\">\\(\\lVert x\\rVert_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in n+1}x(i)^2}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(S^n\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-sphere defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sphere} \\vdash S^n \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n+1} \\mid \\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sphere} \\vdash S^n \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n+1} \\mid \\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sphere: set of points unit distance from origin in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Compactness, connectedness, homotopy, and homology of spheres are downstream theorems.</li>\n<li>Borsuk-Ulam: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: S^n \\to \\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(f: S^n \\to \\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies \\exists x: f(x) = f(-x)\">\\(\\implies \\exists x: f(x) = f(-x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hairy ball: no nowhere-vanishing vector field on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{2k}\">\\(S^{2k}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(S^{2k}) = 2\">\\(\\chi(S^{2k}) = 2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\">\\(S^n\\)</span> parallelizable only for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1,3\">\\(n=1,3\\)</span>; others need at least one &quot;hair&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Milnor, Topology from the Differential Viewpoint</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lVert x\\rVert_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in n+1}x(i)^2}","display":false},{"tex":"S^n\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sphere} \\vdash S^n \\coloneqq \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n+1} \\mid \\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"f: S^n \\to \\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\implies \\exists x: f(x) = f(-x)","display":false},{"tex":"S^{2k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(S^{2k}) = 2","display":false},{"tex":"S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n=1,3","display":false}],"bytes":1033,"backlinks":[{"id":"77a834d62558f993","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad55d3b2dfeece56","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"45d02e8df3a08d98","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$D,k,q,h,\\pi,o,\\gamma,z,C,T\\in V$；$S^1,S^3$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]。"},{"id":"dbc0915e0402cd40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k,q,h,\\pi,\\gamma,z,Q,T\\in V$；$S^d=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{d+1}:\\sum_{i=0}^{d}x_i^2=1\\}$，与 [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]] 的单位球面一致。"},{"id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba4592cee3b1b3f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^{(-)}:\\omega\\to V$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]])"},{"id":"90ebdc5f6dcdaf9b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}$ (单位球面, see [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]])"},{"id":"36a464dda4de9f60","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^{n-1}\\in V\\land\\tau_{S^{n-1}}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S^{n-1})$ (sphere and its standard topology, see [[58-df-sphere]])"},{"id":"de427c699d9a6061","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34aec31cb9fa742a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}$ ($n$-sphere, see [[58-df-sphere]])"},{"id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s_0\\in S^n$ (basepoint of the $n$-sphere, see [[58-df-sphere]])"},{"id":"b7e797c34bb8300c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}^{n+1}\\mid \\|x\\|=1\\}$ (sphere, see [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]])"},{"id":"92f7818d1e7f469c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$, $T\\in V$, and $S^1$ is the unit circle supplied by [[58-df-sphere]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1210","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md|58-df-sphere]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":[]}